공개 사이트에서 카카오톡 타일이 공유 창 대신 링크 복사로 넘어가던 문제. 시험의 대역 SDK도 실제처럼
init 때 Share가 생기게 바꿈(옛 코드에서 실패, 고친 코드에서 통과). 공개 도메인에서 실제 SDK로
카카오 공유 창(로그인 → sharer.kakao.com/picker/link)이 열리는 것을 확인. 공개 빌드 다시 만듦(qa_errors 0).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vhf1SziVAxh1mVM8h72KNg
---
 templates/assets/site.js | 7 +++++--
 tests/test_present.py    | 5 +++--
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/templates/assets/site.js b/templates/assets/site.js
index f3e40c8496..51a459e721 100644
--- a/templates/assets/site.js
+++ b/templates/assets/site.js
@@ -1580,17 +1580,20 @@
     var kakao = function (box) {
       if (kakaoP) return kakaoP;
       var key = box.getAttribute("data-shr-key"), src = box.getAttribute("data-shr-sdk");
+      // Kakao SDK 2.x has no Kakao.Share before Kakao.init (found on the live site 2026-11-12: the SDK came, the
+      // check before init failed, and every press fell back to copying)
       kakaoP = new Promise(function (res, rej) {
-        if (win.Kakao && win.Kakao.Share) { res(win.Kakao); return; }
+        if (win.Kakao && win.Kakao.init) { res(win.Kakao); return; }
         if (!key || !src) { rej(new Error("no key")); return; }
         var s = doc.createElement("script");
         s.src = src;
         if (box.getAttribute("data-shr-sri")) { s.integrity = box.getAttribute("data-shr-sri"); s.crossOrigin = "anonymous"; }
-        s.onload = function () { if (win.Kakao && win.Kakao.Share) res(win.Kakao); else rej(new Error("no Share")); };
+        s.onload = function () { if (win.Kakao && win.Kakao.init) res(win.Kakao); else rej(new Error("no Kakao")); };
         s.onerror = function () { rej(new Error("sdk")); };
         doc.head.appendChild(s);
       }).then(function (K) {
         if (!K.isInitialized()) K.init(key);
+        if (!K.Share || typeof K.Share.sendScrap !== "function") throw new Error("no Share");
         return K;
       });
       kakaoP.catch(function () { kakaoP = null; });   // the next press tries again
diff --git a/tests/test_present.py b/tests/test_present.py
index 8478d93a16..7c0e47f12b 100644
--- a/tests/test_present.py
+++ b/tests/test_present.py
@@ -2428,10 +2428,11 @@ def test_the_send_box_copies_hands_kakaotalk_the_address_and_counts_in_ga4(S, bu
     sync_api = pytest.importorskip("playwright.sync_api")
     e = S.ent_by_slug["모트"]
     path = f"http://site.test{quote(e['_path'])}"
+    # as the real SDK 2.x: no Kakao.Share before Kakao.init (the live site, 2026-11-12)
     kakao_stub = """window.__kakao = [];
 window.Kakao = {_on: false, isInitialized: function () { return this._on; },
-  init: function (k) { this._on = true; window.__kakao.push(['init', k]); },
-  Share: {sendScrap: function (o) { window.__kakao.push(['scrap', o.requestUrl]); }}};"""
+  init: function (k) { this._on = true; window.__kakao.push(['init', k]);
+    this.Share = {sendScrap: function (o) { window.__kakao.push(['scrap', o.requestUrl]); }}; }};"""
     with sync_api.sync_playwright() as p:
         try:
             browser = p.chromium.launch()
